  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earthquake reconstruction project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A reconstruction project to help victims of the earthquake in Pisco, Peru in August 2007. 13 prefabricated units will be built for beneficiary families selected according to a criteria that prioritises those living in extreme poverty. Training in construction of the units will be provided.</narrative>
  </description>
